Don’t force classes to implement methods they don’t use.
Instead of large interfaces, create smaller focused ones.

Bad Example
          class Worker:
              def work(self):
                  pass
          
              def eat(self):
                  pass
          
          
          class Robot(Worker):
              def eat(self):
                  raise Exception("Robot doesn't eat")

Good Example
            class Workable:
                def work(self):
                    pass
            
            class Eatable:
                def eat(self):
                    pass
            
            class Human(Workable, Eatable):
                pass
            
            class Robot(Workable):
                pass
